<!-- Low-battery (warning) alert.
     Material Symbols (Outlined) "battery_low", Apache-2.0. Upstream this one is a LANDSCAPE battery
     (800x400) while the rest of the set is portrait (400x800); both are centred on (480,-480), so the
     90° rotation below lands it exactly on the portrait geometry — terminal nub at the top, fill at the
     bottom. White-on-transparent: notification small icons are rendered as an alpha mask, so only the
     silhouette survives. -->
